      "raw": "<p>I am so sad to have gotten the Greater than Games update this mronign in regards to Vengeance.&nbsp; I recently got turned onto Sentinels of the Multiveser right before the holidays and became obsessed.&nbsp; I literally can NOT speak any more highly of this game to everyone I meet since I just fawn over it.&nbsp; As soon as I got hooked I instantly ordered every single thing I could from the master game to all expansions to even things like extra tokens and as many of the promos as I could find outside of some of the earlier rediculous priced ones.&nbsp; Had I discovered Sentinels of the Multiverse earlier, I would have instantly dropped the money to support Vengeance and been a part of the pre-order list, but now I searched everywhere (including even eBay) to see if I can order one and found right now it is impossible.&nbsp; I wish there was some way to order myself a copy, but have run out of options and have to come to terms with that.&nbsp; I am so sad to miss out on the first run of this set as well as those two promos but am happy for all of you who made the kickstarter/pre-order list and will get it in your hands in only a few weeks time.&nbsp;</p>",
