      "created_at": "2014-01-17T15:49:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You may not get the promos, but GtG is going to be shipping the Vengeance copies in this order: Kickstarter Backers, then Preorders, then Retailers/their own site.</p><p>I'm fairly confident you can expect to see Vengeance in stores and on the GtG Store by late February, once all the backers/preorders are sent.&nbsp; So don't be so glum!&nbsp; As for the promos, if you really want them, I'm sure some people will be selling them on eBay soon (if history is any indicator).&nbsp; Some would rather make a small profit on the promo cards rather than keep them.</p>",
