      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/danmarshall14/{size}/1944_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-01-17T19:19:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Doctor_Fate2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/eada6e/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Doctor_Fate2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Now that I'm aware of Sentinels, I have every intention of continuing to get everything I can get my hands on.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That's exactly how I felt.&nbsp; I got into Sentinels&nbsp;shortly after&nbsp;Shattered Timelines released, so I missed out on a bunch of promos and the Vengeance kickstarter.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>\"Never again!\" I screamed to the stars, fists raised in the air like a madman.</p>\n<p>I preordered Vengeance as soon as it was available and have had my eye on the GtG site ever since; waiting to jump on any opportunity that strikes.</p>",
