      "raw": "[quote=\"Doctor_Fate2000\"]\n\nNow that I&#39;m aware of Sentinels, I have every intention of continuing to get everything I can get my hands on.\n\n[/quote]\n\nThat&#39;s exactly how I felt.&nbsp; I got into Sentinels&nbsp;shortly after&nbsp;Shattered Timelines released, so I missed out on a bunch of promos and the Vengeance kickstarter.&nbsp;\n\n&quot;Never again!&quot; I screamed to the stars, fists raised in the air like a madman.\n\nI preordered Vengeance as soon as it was available and have had my eye on the GtG site ever since; waiting to jump on any opportunity that strikes.\n",
